'@@author Rixte
@startuml
!include ../shortfall/style.iuml

title Successful parsing: edit-recipe 2 p/55 i/Chicken:220g i/Rice:150g
autonumber

participant "MishMash" as App
participant "parser: Parser" as Parser
participant "changes: RecipeChanges" as Changes
participant "edit: EditRecipeCommand" as Edit

App -> Parser : parseCommand(input)
activate Parser
Parser -> Parser : parseNamedCommand("edit-recipe", arguments)
Parser -> Parser : parseEditRecipe(arguments)
Parser -> Parser : parseRecipeIndex("2")
Parser --> Parser : 2
Parser -> Parser : collectRecipeArguments(prefixedFields, fields, ingredients)
loop each prefixed field (p, then i, then i)
  Parser -> Parser : readArgument(prefix, value, fields, ingredients)
  alt ingredient prefix i/
    Parser -> Parser : parseIngredient(value)
    Parser --> Parser : validated GroceryItem
    note right of Parser : Append the item to the local ingredient list.
  else single-value prefix p/
    note right of Parser : Check the prefix and store its unique, nonblank value.
  end
end
Parser -> Parser : parseOptionalNutrition(fields, "cal", "Calories")
Parser --> Parser : null (omitted)
Parser -> Parser : parseOptionalNutrition(fields, "p", "Protein")
Parser -> Parser : parseNutrition("55", "Protein")
Parser --> Parser : 55
note right of Parser
  The omitted c/ and f/ fields also return null.
  n/ and food/ are absent; neither is replaced.
end note
create Changes
Parser -> Changes : new RecipeChanges(null, null, 55, null, null,\ningredients, null)
activate Changes
note right of Changes : Validate supplied values and copy the ingredient list.
Changes --> Parser : changes
deactivate Changes
create Edit
Parser -> Edit : new EditRecipeCommand(2, changes)
Edit --> Parser : edit
Parser --> App : edit as Command
deactivate Parser

note over Parser, Edit
  Map/list setup, ingredient construction, and repeated validation details are condensed.
  No RecipeBook lookup occurs while parsing. Index 2 is resolved only during execution.
  A supplied ingredient list replaces the entire list; omitted fields are read from the target later.
end note
@enduml
'@@author
